data: {"id": "de797b8359a24af1-thinking-parallel_evidence-804", "run_id": "de797b8359a24af1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集的事实如下：\n\n### 已确认身份\n*   **Pod**: `workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l`\n*   **Namespace**: `aiops-case-09`\n*   **Node**: `node2`\n*   **IP**: `172.16.104.35`\n*   **UID**: `13aa0496-5af5-4103-882f-2a096df0dc3f`\n\n### 事实证据\n1.  **NotReady 状态确认**：Kubernetes YAML 和 Describe 确认 `Ready` 状态为 `False`，原因为 `ContainersNotReady`。\n2.  **直接原因 - 探针失败**：`kubectl_describe` 提供了直接证据，Kubelet 报告了两种探针失败：\n    *   早期：`Readiness probe failed: ... dial tcp 172.16.104.35:8080: connect: connection refused`（连接被拒绝，说明服务未在指定端口就绪）。\n    *   ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788809466701, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "de797b8359a24af1-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "de797b8359a24af1", "seq": 805, "ts_ms": 1788809476905, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 74.206, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-09", "name": "workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/de797b8359a24af1-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "472223ce4751ee9538d5e2974cec05a66557ee32d75b5d5c93597f806d8f5e6e", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "acec85e9bbdcf274c63690dc77033fb74859e099b837a19f26b62313db134022"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

